type: software
title: "MedWear Health Analytics"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-20
abstract: >-
  Local-first wearable health analytics research platform: behavioral health index (BHI),
  robust MAD anomaly heuristics, transparent rule-engine screening, optional ONNX inference,
  reproducible benchmarks (seed=42), and clinical decision-support workflow (demo + Apple Health).
